This project downloads and runs the Genie Code CLI (https://github.com/databricks/genie-code-cli)
at runtime. The Genie Code CLI is licensed separately by Databricks under the Databricks License
and may be used only with Databricks services. It is not distributed in this repository.

This project installs the following third-party Python packages at runtime (versions pinned in
requirements.lock). They are not distributed in this repository.

  attrs                       MIT
  certifi                     MPL-2.0
  cffi                        MIT-0
  charset-normalizer          MIT
  cryptography                Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause
  databricks-sdk              Apache-2.0
  google-auth                 Apache-2.0
  idna                        BSD-3-Clause
  jsonschema                  MIT
  jsonschema-specifications   MIT
  protobuf                    BSD-3-Clause
  pyasn1                      BSD-2-Clause
  pyasn1-modules              BSD-2-Clause
  pycparser                   BSD-3-Clause
  pyyaml                      MIT
  referencing                 MIT
  requests                    Apache-2.0
  rpds-py                     MIT
  sqlglot                     MIT
  typing-extensions           PSF-2.0
  urllib3                     MIT

The action also uses these GitHub Actions, pinned by commit SHA in action.yml:
astral-sh/setup-uv, databricks/setup-cli, and actions/upload-artifact.
